      "title": "Prospective Employees",
      "description": "Prospective Employees Skip to main content Current Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Viking Bold Give Careers REQUEST INFO | Search This visually opens the search form. This visually closes the search form. Academics Academics Undergraduate Programs Graduate Programs Academic Calendar Academic Catalog Continuing Education & Workshops Core Curriculum Honor Societies Undergraduate Research Office of Academic Affairs Mikkelsen Library Registrar Student Success Center College of Arts & Sciences Rydell School of Business School of Health Professions School of Music Sharon Lust School of Education Admission & Financial Aid Admission & Financial Aid Admission Counselors Admission Requirements Financial Aid, Costs & Scholarships Test-Optional Admission Admitted Students International Students Transfer Students Global Engagement Global Engagement Prospective International Students Admitted International Students Current International Students Partnerships & Customized Programs Study Abroad Support Global Engagement Student Affairs Student Affairs Accessibility Services Business Office Campus Safety Dean of Students Dining Services Health & Counseling Housing & Residence Life Office of Faith & Spiritual Life Recreational Services Student Engagement Athletics About About About Sioux Falls History Leadership Mission, Vision & Values News Constitution Day Resources Resources Art Galleries & Exhibits Augustana Research Institute Camps & Lessons Campus Learning Center Conferences & Scheduling Directory Events Calendar Office of Advancement Office of Human Resources Theatre Performances VISIT APPLY Prospective Employees Breadcrumb Home Resources Prospective Employees Careers at AU If you’re looking for meaningful employment and want to be part of something bigger than yourself, consider joining Augustana University — a top-ranked regional university. Guided by its five core values — Christian, liberal arts, excellence, community and service — AU provides students with an education of enduring worth. In 2020, AU launched its strategic plan — Viking Bold: The Journey to 2030 — the largest fundraising campaign in the university’s history. Augustana is located in the heart of Sioux Falls — South Dakota’s largest city. Given the unlimited opportunities for entertainment and recreation, a robust economy and low cost of living, Sioux Falls is consistently recognized as a great place to work, live, launch a career, start a business and raise a family. Augustana invites you to discover exciting career opportunities through its ADP recruitment website . The portal lists current openings, along with detailed job descriptions, qualifications and application instructions. By visiting AU's ADP career website, you can: explore open positions across the university, learn more about role responsibilities and requirements, and, access step-by-step details on how to apply online. Whether you are looking for faculty, staff or student employment, the ADP portal is the best place to begin your journey with Augustana University. Explore Employment Opportunities Office of Human Resources Viking Bold Strategic Plan City of Sioux Falls Job Opportunities at AU Watch Video ADMINISTRATIVE POSITIONS ATHLETICS POSITIONS FACULTY POSITIONS SUPPORT STAFF POSITIONS BENEFITS EMPLOYMENT APPLICATION Contact Us 605.274.4110 | Fax: 605.274.5547 Office of Human Resources Email Address Augustana University Office of Human Resources Administration Building (First Floor) 2101 S. Summit Avenue Sioux Falls, SD 57197 | Augustana University is an Equal Opportunity/Affirmative Action/Title IX Employer. Applicants must comply with the Immigration Reform and Control Act and may be required to submit official transcripts upon employment. Finalist candidates must satisfactorily complete a pre-employment background check. 2001 S. Summit Avenue Sioux Falls, South Dakota 57197 605.274.0770 605.274.0770 800.727.2844 800.727.2844 Explore Academics Admission & Financial Aid Global Engagement Student Affairs Athletics About Resources News Directory AU Merchandise Campus Safety Center for Western Studies Library Connect Current Students Faculty & Staff Alumni Give Careers Search augie.edu Search Apply to Augustana Visit Augustana Augustana University is committed to providing equal access to and participation in employment opportunities, programs and services, without regard to race, color, religion, creed, sex, pregnancy, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, national origin, ancestry, age, veteran status, or disability. Augustana complies with Title IX of the Education Amendments of 1972, Title VII of the Civil Rights Act, the Americans with Disabilities Act, Rehabilitation Act and other applicable laws providing for nondiscrimination against all individuals. AU will provide reasonable accommodations for known disabilities to the extent required by law. © 2026 Augustana University · All rights reserved. Accessibility Statement Consumer Disclosures Complaints & Concerns FCC File Freedom of Speech & Expression Privacy Policy RSS"
